  "metadata": {
    "title": "BERT hides tokens and predicts them from both sides",
    "description": "BERT chooses 15 percent of tokens; 80 percent become [MASK], 10 percent are replaced by random tokens, and 10 percent stay unchanged. A bidirectional encoder predicts the original token at chosen positions only."
